---
description: solomad product constraints
alwaysApply: true
---

The product name in the interface is solomad. The three tabs are Discover, Trips, and Chats.

Production and staging must reject emulator endpoints, fixture providers, authentication bypasses, test entitlement overrides, and missing critical configuration.

Do not invent credentials, App Store products, cloud resources, domains, provider responses, successful builds, deployments, or benchmark results.

Offline joins must not claim a place was reserved. Birth dates stay private. Client-supplied user ids and premium flags are not authorization.

PostgreSQL is the authority for membership, entitlements, and message history.
